.TH KTX_TRANSCODE 1 "2026-10-27" "ktx (Rust port)" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ktx_transcode \- transcode a Basis Universal KTX2 file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ktx
transcode [OPTION...] <input\-file> <output\-file>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Transcodes a KTX2 file holding Basis\-LZ, UASTC or UASTC HDR data to a GPU block format or to
uncompressed pixels.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-target <target>
Target such as etc\-rgba, bc7, astc, r8 or rgba8.
.TP
.B \-\-zstd <level>, \-\-zlib <level>
Supercompress the result.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
ktx transcode \-\-target bc7 in.ktx2 out.ktx2
.fi
.SH NOTES
This is an unofficial Rust port of Khronos KTX\-Software (libktx and the ktx CLI); it is not
the Khronos build of the tool. The complete, current option list is printed by
.B ktx transcode \-\-help.
.SH SEE ALSO
ktx(1)
